{"id":"3579e07be41aa5cd","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-product.md","title":"Product of Sets","display":"df-product — Product of Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-product","aliases":["58-df-product","Set Product"],"display":"df-product — Product of Sets","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-product</span><span>Set Product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-product — Product of Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,X,P,\\pi\\in V\">\\(I,X,P,\\pi\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\)</span> (set-coded family indexed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProductProjection}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProductProjection}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S(P,X,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\n\\land P=\n\\left\\{\nf\\in\\left(\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(X)\\right)^I:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in X(i))\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S(P,X,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\n\\land P=\n\\left\\{\nf\\in\\left(\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(X)\\right)^I:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in X(i))\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProductProjection}_S(\\pi,i,P,X,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S(P,X,I)\n\\land i\\in I\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,P,X(i))\n\\land\\forall f\\in P\\;(\\pi(f)=f(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProductProjection}_S(\\pi,i,P,X,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S(P,X,I)\n\\land i\\in I\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,P,X(i))\n\\land\\forall f\\in P\\;(\\pi(f)=f(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The product may be empty; nonemptiness for arbitrary families is the content of a choice principle.</li>\n<li>Product topology and categorical products outside Set require additional structure and are not aliases of this set construction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,X,P,\\pi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(X))","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProductProjection}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S(P,X,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\n\\land P=\n\\left\\{\nf\\in\\left(\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(X)\\right)^I:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(f(i)\\in X(i))\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}product\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProductProjection}_S(\\pi,i,P,X,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SetProduct}_S(P,X,I)\n\\land i\\in I\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,P,X(i))\n\\land\\forall f\\in P\\;(\\pi(f)=f(i)).","display":true}],"bytes":1286,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a2eba7a6158f6b0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3f7a2eae516684d4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61ac15dc25814c95","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e942ab724bac5e6c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f099bf27843654d6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":"